(function(E){ const x = E["sales-m3"] = E["sales-m3"] || {units:{}}; x.units["sales-cp-3"] = {"exit":{"id":"c-sales-cp-3-x","course":"sales","unit":"sales-cp-3","type":"exit","items":[{"from":"sales-3-1","kind":"blank","prompt":"___ our lead time is longer, we pack each order by hand.","options":["Despite","Although","However"],"correct":1,"point":2,"why":{"en":"Although: a full clause follows (our lead time is longer). 'Despite' needs a noun, and 'However' starts a new sentence.","tr":"Although: ardından tam bir yan cümle gelir (our lead time is longer). 'Despite' isim ister; 'However' yeni bir cümle başlatır.","fa":"Although درست است، چون بعدش جمله‌ی کامل می‌آید. despite اسم می‌خواهد و however جمله‌ی تازه شروع می‌کند."}},{"from":"sales-3-1","kind":"mcq","prompt":"The buyer says \"We have a supplier.\" Which reply is best?","options":["They are bad, and everybody in the trade knows it.","That's good. What would you change about them?","I can give you 20% off to change supplier today."],"correct":1,"point":1,"why":{"en":"It agrees, then finds what they would improve. Attacking their supplier insults their choice, and 20% off gives money away.","tr":"Önce kabul eder, sonra neyi iyileştirmek istediklerini bulur. Tedarikçilerine saldırmak seçimlerine hakaret eder; %20 indirim parayı boşa verir.","fa":"اول می‌پذیرد و بعد می‌فهمد چه چیزی را می‌خواهند بهتر کنند. بد گفتن از تأمین‌کننده‌شان به انتخابشان توهین می‌کند و ۲۰ درصد تخفیف پول را هدر می‌دهد."}},{"from":"sales-3-2","kind":"blank","prompt":"If you ___ a second container, we could cut the freight.","options":["took","take","would take"],"correct":0,"point":2,"why":{"en":"took: 'we could' shows a possible trade, so 'if' takes the past. 'Take' goes with 'we can', and 'would take' doesn't follow if here.","tr":"took: 'we could' olası bir takası gösterir, bu yüzden 'if' geçmiş zaman alır. 'Take' 'we can' ile gelir; 'would take' burada if'ten sonra gelmez.","fa":"took درست است، چون we could یک معامله‌ی احتمالی است و بعد از if گذشته می‌آید. take با we can می‌آید و would take اینجا بعد از if نمی‌آید."}},{"from":"sales-3-2","kind":"mcq","prompt":"What should you never tell a buyer?","options":["Your limit","Your payment terms","Your lead time"],"correct":0,"point":1,"why":{"en":"Your limit: once the buyer knows it, every offer drops to it. Payment terms and lead time are things you must share.","tr":"Your limit: alıcı bunu öğrenince her teklif oraya iner. Ödeme koşulları ve teslim süresi paylaşman gereken bilgilerdir.","fa":"Your limit درست است، چون وقتی خریدار حدت را بداند هر پیشنهادی تا همان‌جا پایین می‌آید. شرایط پرداخت و زمان تحویل را باید بگویی."}},{"from":"sales-3-3","kind":"blank","prompt":"All the invoices ___ in USD.","options":["are issue","are issued","issued"],"correct":1,"point":2,"why":{"en":"are issued: invoices receive the action, so be + past participle. 'Are issue' drops -d, and 'issued' alone says the invoices did it.","tr":"are issued: faturalar eylemi alır, bu yüzden be + üçüncü hâl. 'Are issue' -d'yi düşürür; tek başına 'issued' işi faturaların yaptığını söyler.","fa":"are issued درست است، چون فاکتور صادر می‌شود و be و اسم مفعول لازم است. are issue بدون ‎-d است و issued تنها یعنی خود فاکتورها کاری کرده‌اند."}},{"from":"sales-3-3","kind":"mcq","prompt":"Which document is the carrier's receipt for the goods?","options":["Packing list","Bill of lading","Proforma invoice"],"correct":1,"point":1,"why":{"en":"Bill of lading: the carrier issues it when it receives the goods. A packing list lists the contents; a proforma is a draft invoice.","tr":"Bill of lading: taşıyıcı malı teslim alınca düzenler. Packing list içeriği listeler; proforma ön faturadır.","fa":"Bill of lading را حمل‌کننده وقتی کالا را تحویل می‌گیرد صادر می‌کند. packing list محتوا را می‌گوید و پروفرما پیش‌فاکتور است."}},{"from":"sales-2-3","kind":"blank","prompt":"We can't hold this price unless you ___ this week.","options":["confirm","don't confirm","will confirm"],"correct":0,"point":2,"why":{"en":"confirm: after 'unless', use the present with no 'not'. 'Don't confirm' makes a double negative; 'will confirm' is wrong after unless.","tr":"confirm: 'unless'ten sonra geniş zaman gelir, olumsuzluk eklenmez. 'Don't confirm' çift olumsuz yapar; 'will confirm' unless'ten sonra yanlıştır.","fa":"confirm درست است، چون بعد از unless زمان حال می‌آید و منفی نمی‌شود. don't confirm منفیِ دوتایی است و will confirm بعد از unless غلط است."}},{"from":"sales-2-2","kind":"mcq","prompt":"Under CIF, where does the risk pass?","options":["At the port of destination","On board at the port of loading","At the buyer's warehouse"],"correct":1,"point":1,"why":{"en":"On board at the port of loading: under CIF the seller pays freight to the destination, but the risk passes earlier. That is the common trap.","tr":"Yükleme limanında gemide: CIF'te satıcı varış limanına kadar navlunu öder ama risk daha önce geçer. Sık düşülen tuzak budur.","fa":"روی کشتی در بندر بارگیری؛ در CIF فروشنده کرایه تا مقصد را می‌دهد، ولی ریسک زودتر منتقل می‌شود. دام رایج همین است."}}]},"writing":{"id":"c-sales-cp-3-w","course":"sales","unit":"sales-cp-3","type":"writing","difficulty":"medium","modelBy":"FEschool","portfolio":null,"title":{"en":"Your deal sheet","tr":"Anlaşma sayfan","fa":"برگه‌ی معامله‌ی تو"},"prompt":{"en":"Project. Use your own deal, or: a buyer said \"too expensive\" about 300 kg of figs at USD 7.00 and asked for 60 days to pay. You agreed USD 6.80 for 600 kg, FOB Izmir, with 30% in advance and 30 days for the rest. Write a deal summary to the buyer (80-110 words): the objection in one line, what each side gave, the final terms in the passive, and what happens next.","tr":"Proje. Kendi anlaşmanı ya da şunu kullan: bir alıcı kilosu 7,00 dolar olan 300 kg incir için \"too expensive\" dedi ve 60 gün vade istedi. 600 kg için 6,80 dolarda, FOB İzmir, %30 peşin ve kalanı 30 gün vadeyle anlaştınız. Alıcıya anlaşma özeti yaz (80-110 kelime): tek satırda itiraz, her tarafın ne verdiği, edilgen yapıyla son koşullar ve sonra ne olacağı.","fa":"پروژه. از معامله‌ی خودت یا این استفاده کن: خریداری درباره‌ی ۳۰۰ کیلو انجیر با قیمت ۷ دلار گفته «too expensive» و ۶۰ روز مهلت پرداخت خواسته. روی ۶۰۰ کیلو با قیمت ۶٫۸۰ دلار، FOB ازمیر، ۳۰ درصد پیش‌پرداخت و مانده با ۳۰ روز مهلت توافق کرده‌اید. برای خریدار خلاصه‌ی معامله بنویس (۸۰ تا ۱۱۰ کلمه): اعتراض در یک خط، اینکه هر طرف چه داد، شرایط نهایی با فعل مجهول، و قدم بعدی."},"model":"Dear Mr Novotny,\n\nThank you for today's call. You felt the price was high for 300 kg, so we looked at a bigger order. You agreed to take 600 kg, and we agreed to USD 6.80 a kilo.\n\nThe final terms are as follows. The goods will be shipped FOB Izmir, Incoterms 2020. 30% will be paid in advance, and the rest within 30 days of the bill of lading.\n\nThe order confirmation will be sent tomorrow. Could you check it and send your purchase order by Friday?\n\nBest regards","frame":"Dear ___,\n\nThank you for ___. You felt ___, so we ___. You agreed to ___, and we agreed to ___.\n\nThe final terms are as follows. The goods will be shipped ___. ___ will be paid ___.\n\nThe order confirmation will be sent ___. Could you ___?\n\nBest regards","words":[{"word":"You agreed"},{"word":"will be shipped"},{"word":"will be paid"}],"minWords":70,"minSentences":5,"rubric":["Task done: the objection, what each side gave, final terms, next step","Organised: the talk first, the terms next, the request last","Language: passive, and past for what was agreed","Tone: fair and exact; both sides are shown giving something"],"rubricI18n":{"tr":["Görev: itiraz, her tarafın verdiği, son koşullar, sonraki adım","Düzen: önce görüşme, sonra koşullar, en sonda istek","Dil: edilgen yapı; anlaşılanlar için geçmiş zaman","Üslup: adil ve net; iki taraf da bir şey veriyor"],"fa":["کامل بودن کار: اعتراض، چیزی که هر طرف داد، شرایط نهایی، قدم بعدی","نظم: اول گفت‌وگو، بعد شرایط، آخر درخواست","زبان: مجهول، و گذشته برای آنچه توافق شد","لحن: منصفانه و دقیق؛ هر دو طرف چیزی داده‌اند"]}},"speaking":{"id":"sales-cp-3","course":"sales","unit":"sales-cp-3","topic":{"en":"Negotiate your deal aloud","tr":"Anlaşman için yüksek sesle pazarlık et","fa":"مذاکره‌ی معامله‌ات را با صدای بلند تمرین کن"},"warmup":{"en":"Say your limit to yourself, and your plan if there is no deal. Don't say them to the buyer.","tr":"Sınırını ve anlaşma olmazsa planını kendine söyle. Alıcıya söyleme.","fa":"حد نهایی و برنامه‌ی جایگزینت را برای خودت بگو. به خریدار نگو."},"questions":[{"en":"The buyer says: \"You are too expensive.\" Pause, agree, ask, answer.","tr":"Alıcı diyor ki: \"You are too expensive.\" Dur, kabul et, sor, cevap ver.","fa":"خریدار می‌گوید: «You are too expensive.» مکث کن، موافقت کن، بپرس، جواب بده."},{"en":"Offer one trade with If you..., we could....","tr":"If you..., we could... ile bir takas öner.","fa":"با If you..., we could... یک بده‌بستان پیشنهاد کن."},{"en":"Repeat the deal, and say which documents will be sent.","tr":"Anlaşmayı tekrar et ve hangi belgelerin gönderileceğini söyle.","fa":"توافق را تکرار کن و بگو چه مدارکی می‌فرستی."}],"followups":[{"en":"Which of your own deals could you try this on next week?","tr":"Gelecek hafta bunu kendi anlaşmalarından hangisinde deneyebilirsin?","fa":"هفته‌ی بعد این را روی کدام معامله‌ی خودت امتحان می‌کنی؟"}],"expressions":[{"phrase":"Compared with what?","meaning":{"en":"Finds the other offer.","tr":"Diğer teklifi bulur.","fa":"پیشنهاد دیگر را روشن می‌کند."}},{"phrase":"If you ..., we could ...","meaning":{"en":"Offers a trade.","tr":"Takas önerir.","fa":"بده‌بستان پیشنهاد می‌کند."}},{"phrase":"So, to confirm, ...","meaning":{"en":"Repeats the deal.","tr":"Anlaşmayı tekrar eder.","fa":"توافق را تکرار می‌کند."}}],"model":"I understand. Compared with what? What matters most to you? I see. Although our price is higher, we ship in three weeks. If you doubled the order, we could offer six dollars eighty. And if you paid thirty percent in advance, we could give you thirty days for the rest. So, to confirm: six hundred kilos at six dollars eighty. The order confirmation will be sent tomorrow.","selfCheck":[{"en":"I asked before I offered.","tr":"Teklif etmeden önce sordum.","fa":"قبل از پیشنهاد پرسیدم."},{"en":"I traded; I gave nothing for free.","tr":"Takas ettim; bedava bir şey vermedim.","fa":"بده‌بستان کردم؛ چیزی را مجانی ندادم."},{"en":"I didn't say my limit.","tr":"Sınırımı söylemedim.","fa":"حد نهایی‌ام را نگفتم."},{"en":"I repeated the deal.","tr":"Anlaşmayı tekrar ettim.","fa":"توافق را تکرار کردم."}]}}; })(globalThis.COURSE_FILES = globalThis.COURSE_FILES || {});
